"t1":{"x":0,"y":-300,"text":"1 · Parties and invites","kind":"title1","maxW":2740},
"t2":{"x":0,"y":900,"text":"2 · Spots and privacy controls","kind":"title1","maxW":2740},
"t3":{"x":0,"y":3400,"text":"3 · Meetup: alert, map, chat, meet point, compass, location requests","kind":"title1","maxW":3210},
"s1":{"x":2820,"y":0,"w":360,"size":"m","fill":"blue","text":"Invite link = party ID + one-time MLS key package secret in the URL fragment (never sent to server). Joining shows a safety code to compare in person or over a call."},
"s2":{"x":2820,"y":1200,"w":360,"size":"m","fill":"orange","text":"All three controls run on the phone before anything is sent: Focus/DND check, exclusion-zone check, then Spot matching. While paused the phone still sends fixed-rate dummy tokens, so the server cannot tell paused from out-of-range."},
"s4":{"x":3290,"y":4220,"w":360,"size":"m","fill":"purple","text":"Exact spot = per-person location key. Everyone in the meetup sees you're here; your position frames are sealed under your own key, which you hand (HPKE) only to people you approve. Revoking or a 15-minute expiry rotates the key. With no one approved you still send same-size dummy frames, so nobody can tell whether you share."},
"s3":{"x":3290,"y":3700,"w":360,"size":"m","fill":"teal","text":"Meetup = short-lived group keyed only to the members whose presence tokens matched. Late joiners get added on entry; leavers are removed and the key rotates. When the last person leaves, everyone deletes the keys and content."}
},
